    "reason": "[ev-da7ff24b2c60] says only that Strimzi \"adopted new Kafka Connect health check endpoint\" and refers to proposal 89, which is not excerpted. It does not name the endpoint, the Strimzi resource kinds whose probes change, or a version boundary. The section context [ev-17b3774eb9ee] treats Kafka Connect and Kafka MirrorMaker 2 as related Connect-based operands, so a condition limited to KafkaConnect could miss exposed MirrorMaker 2 deployments. The proposed condition also has no API group or version. To settle this I need the text of proposal 89 or the upgrade docs that say which operands (KafkaConnect, KafkaMirrorMaker2) and which Kafka versions use the new endpoint.",
